":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、负责业务应用系统的后端设计开发；\n2、参与系统全流程质量保障，包括测试部署、版本管理、性能优化调优以及日常运维等工作；\n3、保障系统代码安全及遵循各项合规性要求；\n4、与测试团队协作，能快速响应业务需求，编写技术文档；\n5、负责引入前沿技术（包括 AI、智能化研发工具等），提升整体研发效能与交付质量。","Require":"1、国内外高校硕士研究生及以上学历，计算机及相关专业，技术经验优秀者可适当放宽；\n2、3-5年以上Java开发经验，熟练使用SpringBoot、 MVC、微服务等主流框架，熟悉IO、多线程、分布式、缓存、消息等机制，具备一定JVM调优与故障排查经验;\n3、掌握常用设计模式，有良好的抽象设计能力，具备应对大数据、分布式、高并发、高可用等系统设计和性能调优能力;\n4、精通 SQL 及常用 BI 工具，熟悉数据库MySQL/PostgreSQL，熟悉Python开发，熟悉数仓建模原理以及分层架构实现，有AI编程、AI工具使用经验优先；\n5、思路清晰能独立分析和解决问题，善于沟通协作，责任心强，具备良好的学习能力、团队合作精神，工作积极、主动、责任心强。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-19T17:53:14","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"19819e9d-7f04-47f4-b64e-053d95ff3387","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270986054,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"运营支持类-法务方向（私募）(J10766)","OrgId":1165059,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、配合私募股权投资业务各环节的合规审核，参与项目尽职调查中的法务合规核查工作，出具合规审核意见；\n2、配合私募股权投资业务合