推动事项落地闭环。\n4. 具备良好的职业道德与专业素质，学习理解能力突出，能快速掌握新知识并应用于实际工作；抗压与适应能力强，追求卓越、自驱成长。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-24T17:42:27","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"908f37a9-ce1c-445d-9a40-5a4065d8ebb3","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270986046,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"交易类-债券交易方向(J10747)","OrgId":1165058,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、跟踪宏观、利率及信用市场走势，研究利率传导逻辑及券种定价规律，参与挖掘市场交易机会，捕捉波段交易窗口，及时向投资经理反馈、传递市场变动情况.\r\n2、配合投资及做市台需求，参与对接各债券、利率衍生品及各类做市投资相关业务，保证询价、报价、对冲、分销等交易业务的顺利开展，协助交易策略精准落地。\r\n3、完成部门交办的其他实习任务。","Require":"1.国内外高校硕士研究生及以上学历在校生，金融、会计、经济类等相关专业，复合背景优先（该岗位需参加公司实习生计划）。\n2.对机构销售工作感兴趣并葆有热情，具备良好的人际交往能力，喜欢主动与他人建立联系并进行分享交流；\n3.具备出色的沟通表达与团队协作能力，执行力强、目标导向，能高效推动事项落地闭环。\n4.具备良好的职业道德与专业素质，学习理解能力突出，能快速掌握新知识并应用于实际工作；抗压与适应能力强，追求卓越、自驱成长。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Cla